<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><title>{{.Heading}} · bitcoin++</title>{{block "header" .}}{{end}}<link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/shop.css?v=20260718-11"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/service-checkout.css?v=4"></head><body class="shop-page">{{block "mainnav" .}}{{end}}
<main class="service-checkout service-checkout--account"><nav class="service-account-nav" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol><li><a href="/dashboard">Dashboard</a></li><li><a href="/dashboard/subscriptions">Subscriptions</a></li><li><a href="/services/alerts/manage">Alerts billing</a></li><li aria-current="page">Payment method</li></ol></nav><section>
<header class="service-checkout__head"><span class="service-kicker">BITCOIN++ ALERTS</span><h1>{{.Heading}}</h1></header><p role="status">{{.Message}}</p>
{{if .Button}}<form method="post" action="/services/alerts/payment-method"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="{{.CSRF}}"><input type="hidden" name="change" value="{{.ID}}"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="{{.Action}}"><button class="service-primary">{{.Button}}</button></form>{{end}}
{{if .PayURL}}<p><a class="service-primary" href="{{.PayURL}}">Continue with Bitcoin</a></p>{{end}}
{{if .OrderURL}}<p><a class="service-primary" href="{{.OrderURL}}">View Bitcoin payment</a></p>{{if .CanWithdraw}}<p>Keeping card billing will cancel this unstarted Bitcoin order.</p>{{else}}<p>Card renewal remains off. A Bitcoin payment has been initiated or paid; contact support before switching back, so a late payment cannot overlap a card renewal.</p>{{end}}{{end}}
{{if .CanRestartBitcoin}}<form method="post" action="/services/alerts/payment-method"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="{{.CSRF}}"><input type="hidden" name="change" value="{{.ID}}"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="refresh_bitcoin"><p>If your quote expired, cancel the unstarted order and prepare a fresh quote.</p><button class="service-primary">Start a new Bitcoin checkout</button></form>{{end}}{{if .CanWithdraw}}<form method="post" action="/services/alerts/payment-method"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="{{.CSRF}}"><input type="hidden" name="change" value="{{.ID}}"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="withdraw"><p>Changed your mind? Keep automatic annual card payments at your current quantity.</p><button class="service-primary">Keep card billing</button></form>{{end}}
<p><a href="/services/alerts/manage">Back to Alerts billing</a></p></section><aside class="service-summary"><img src="/static/img/alerts-checkout.svg" alt="" width="640" height="360"><div class="service-summary__body"><h2>Payment settings</h2><p>Your three free projects remain included. Bitcoin payments are prepaid and never renew automatically.</p></div></aside></main></body></html>
